You focus yourself on nature, allowing you to summon natural creatures much faster ([69%, 56%, 49%, 43%, 39% (TL1-5)] of a normal summon time) and with no chance to fail from high equilibrium for [3, 4, 4, 5, 5 (TL1-5)] turns.

When activating this power, a random summoning talent will come off cooldown.

Each time you summon, the duration of the frantic summoning effect will reduce by 1.
